menu "SempreIoT identity (siot_identity)"

    config SIOT_DEV_MODEL
        string "Device model string"
        default "SIOT-NODE-01"
        help
            Reported in /info and INSTALLATION and used to select the pin map
            (siot_board_def, tools/pinmap/pinmap.yaml). A board image must use
            a model starting with "SIOT-BOARD" so the installer app's wizard
            recognises it (pocs/APP-BRIEF.md section 5).

    config SIOT_FACTORY_PARTITION
        string "NVS partition holding the factory identity"
        default "nvs_factory"
        help
            Written once by tools/make_sticker.py + nvs_partition_gen.py,
            read-only in firmware, survives a full erase of "nvs"
            (OTA blueprint section 1, brief section 4.1).

endmenu
